      "npc" : "Director",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You may have heard the explanation when you came, but to briefly introduce you to this place, there is still a long way to go. We are working on converting many weapons, armor, accessories, etc. into something different.",
      "translation" : "你来的时候可能听过介绍，不过我还是简单说一下。这里还有很多地方没开放。我们正在把各种武器、防具、饰品等改造成不同的装备。"
